"""Specs for docs/battle-theatre/drill/drill_artillery.json.
Primary text: FIELDART-1863 = "Instruction for Field Artillery" prepared by the Light Artillery Board (French, Barry, Hunt), approved 6 March 1860, Lippincott edition dated 1863
(fetched under the one-extra-text allowance because Gibbon contains no detachment drill). Supporting text: GIBBON-1860 (The Artillerist's Manual)."""

FA, GB = 'FIELDART-1863', 'GIBBON-1860'

